tish\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0283-068859d50fa1:d06\", \"text\": \") . Encyclopedia of Rugby Union Football . London : Robert Hale . ISBN 0-7091-5394-5 . Marshall , Howard ; Jordon , J.P. ( 1951 ) . Oxford v Cambridge , The Story of the University Rugby Match . London : Clerke & Cockeran . Midgley , Ruth ( 1979 ) . The Official World Encyclopedia of Sports and Games . London : Diagram Group . ISBN 0-7092-0153-2 . Richards , Huw ( 2007 ) . A Game for Hooligans : The History of Rugby Union . Edinburgh : Mainstream Publishing . ISBN 978-1-84596-255-5 . Stubbs , Ray ( 2009\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"Rugby\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"Scott Murray is a Scottish rugby player known for his career in the sport.\"}"
